 values ('WODDI-WI-002', 'WGMN', 1, 1, 2, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Leadership Begins With the Heart', 'Care and accountability together create leadership people can trust.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WGMN leadership is laying a foundation of identity, purpose and dependable service. Mature leadership is seen in the way we hold purpose, people and responsibility together. As you consider ''Leadership Begins With the Heart'', look at the part of the network entrusted to you. Choose the response that protects dignity, strengthens confidence and moves the work forward. Consistent service, offered without unnecessary pressure, builds the kind of trust that lasts.', 'Care and accountability together create leadership people can trust.',
  'Thank you for leading WGMN with purpose and care.', 'WGMN — Nurturing women, strengthening families.', 'wi002-wgmn', 'Confident African woman aged 30 or above leader moving forward in a bright, open setting; subtle sense of direction, possibility and purpose. Build as a polished WODDI/WGMN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
