 values ('WODDI-WI-004', 'WGMN', 1, 1, 4, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'The Power of Showing Up Consistently', 'Healthy service protects both the mission and the woman who serves.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WGMN leadership is laying a foundation of identity, purpose and dependable service. Women often carry several responsibilities at the same time, so intentional leadership matters. Let ''The Power of Showing Up Consistently'' help you identify what deserves attention now, what can be delegated and what must be followed through. A clear and measured action can protect your wellbeing while still strengthening the women and leaders who depend on your guidance.', 'Healthy service protects both the mission and the woman who serves.',
  'Thank you for leading WGMN with purpose and care.', 'WGMN — Nurturing women, strengthening families.', 'wi004-wgmn', 'Authentic African woman aged 30 or above volunteer leader in purposeful action; professional natural light; WODDI colour accents; uncluttered composition. Build as a polished WODDI/WGMN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
