 values ('WODDI-WI-004', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 4, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'You Do Not Have to Be Perfect to Begin', 'You can ask for guidance and still be a strong young leader.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. Young leadership grows through practice. Let ''You Do Not Have to Be Perfect to Begin'' guide one real decision this week. You may be balancing education, work, family responsibilities and service, so choose a step that is clear and realistic. Completing one meaningful action with integrity is stronger than making many promises you cannot sustain.', 'You can ask for guidance and still be a strong young leader.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi004-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
