 values ('WODDI-WI-005', 'WGMN', 1, 1, 5, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Women Who Lift Other Women Build Nations', 'What leaders practise consistently becomes the culture families and communities experience.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WGMN leadership is laying a foundation of identity, purpose and dependable service. A strong network is built when experienced women keep learning and remain willing to improve. Reflect on ''Women Who Lift Other Women Build Nations'' within your own sphere of responsibility. Notice one practice that should continue and one that should change. Honest reflection, respectful communication and accurate follow-through turn shared values into lasting organisational culture.', 'What leaders practise consistently becomes the culture families and communities experience.',
  'Thank you for leading WGMN with purpose and care.', 'WGMN — Nurturing women, strengthening families.', 'wi005-wgmn', 'Authentic African woman aged 30 or above volunteer leader in purposeful action; professional natural light; WODDI colour accents; uncluttered composition. Build as a polished WODDI/WGMN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
