 values ('WODDI-WI-005', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 5, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Young Women With Values Can Change Communities', 'The habits you build today are shaping the influence you will carry tomorrow.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. You are allowed to learn while you lead. Reflect on ''Young Women With Values Can Change Communities'' and notice where you have grown, where you need help and what you can try differently. Ask a trusted leader or mentor for guidance when necessary. Growth becomes stronger when courage, humility and responsibility work together.', 'The habits you build today are shaping the influence you will carry tomorrow.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi005-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
