 values ('WODDI-WI-006', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 6, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Your Voice Matters', 'Digital influence should always reflect dignity, safety and good judgement.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. WNNN exists so young women can develop voice, values, confidence and the ability to serve their communities. This week''s theme, ''Your Voice Matters'', is an opportunity to make that purpose visible. Include another young woman, complete the action within your authority and share an accurate update through WDOS. Your growth matters, and the example you set can make it safer for another young woman to grow too.', 'Digital influence should always reflect dignity, safety and good judgement.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi006-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
