 values ('WODDI-WI-007', 'WGMN', 1, 1, 7, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Identity Gives Leadership Direction', 'Leadership is strongest when women leave other women stronger.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WGMN leadership is laying a foundation of identity, purpose and dependable service. Your service forms part of a wider African network of women leading with identity and purpose. As you focus on ''Identity Gives Leadership Direction'', remember that local actions contribute to continental progress. One thoughtful conversation, completed task or supported leader can deepen belonging and move the WGMN vision closer to the women it exists to serve.', 'Leadership is strongest when women leave other women stronger.',
  'Thank you for leading WGMN with purpose and care.', 'WGMN — Nurturing women, strengthening families.', 'wi007-wgmn', 'Authentic African woman aged 30 or above volunteer leader in purposeful action; professional natural light; WODDI colour accents; uncluttered composition. Build as a polished WODDI/WGMN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
