 values ('WODDI-WI-007', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 7, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Confidence Grows When You Take Responsibility', 'Your growth can open a path for another young woman.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. Across Africa, young women are bringing fresh ideas and energy to leadership. As you focus on ''Confidence Grows When You Take Responsibility'', remember that innovation still requires discipline, safeguarding and respect. Use your creativity to solve a real problem, listen to the people affected and follow through on the commitment you make.', 'Your growth can open a path for another young woman.',
