 values ('WODDI-WI-008', 'WGMN', 1, 1, 8, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Purpose Makes Service Meaningful', 'Dignity must remain visible in every decision, message and follow-up.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WGMN leadership is laying a foundation of identity, purpose and dependable service. Responsible leadership combines care with accountability. The focus ''Purpose Makes Service Meaningful'' asks you to bring both into this week''s decisions. Be clear about expectations, kind in your approach and dependable in follow-through. This balance helps women feel valued while keeping the work, records and relationships of the network strong.', 'Dignity must remain visible in every decision, message and follow-up.',
  'Thank you for leading WGMN with purpose and care.', 'WGMN — Nurturing women, strengthening families.', 'wi008-wgmn', 'Confident African woman aged 30 or above leader moving forward in a bright, open setting; subtle sense of direction, possibility and purpose. Build as a polished WODDI/WGMN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
