 values ('WODDI-WI-008', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 8, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Do Not Hide Your Light', 'Purpose becomes visible when you complete the next responsible step.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. Leadership is not a performance; it is the responsible use of influence. The focus ''Do Not Hide Your Light'' asks you to be clear, teachable and consistent this week. Choose what is right over what merely looks impressive. The habits you build now will shape the leader, mentor and community builder you become.', 'Purpose becomes visible when you complete the next responsible step.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi008-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
