 values ('WODDI-WI-009', 'WGMN', 1, 1, 9, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Values Are Your Leadership Compass', 'Rooted women lead with purpose and strengthen others through their example.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WGMN leadership is laying a foundation of identity, purpose and dependable service. Your leadership reaches women, families and communities through the choices you make each day. This week''s focus, ''Values Are Your Leadership Compass'', invites you to turn experience into an example others can trust. Apply it with wisdom, dignity and steady follow-through. When one woman leads responsibly, she makes it easier for other women to grow, contribute and strengthen the people around them.', 'Rooted women lead with purpose and strengthen others through their example.',
  'Thank you for leading WGMN with purpose and care.', 'WGMN — Nurturing women, strengthening families.', 'wi009-wgmn', 'Authentic African woman aged 30 or above volunteer leader in purposeful action; professional natural light; WODDI colour accents; uncluttered composition. Build as a polished WODDI/WGMN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
