 values ('WODDI-WI-009', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 9, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Purpose Before Pressure', 'You are not waiting to become a leader; you are learning to lead responsibly now.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. You do not need to wait for a future title or a perfect moment to lead well. This week''s focus, ''Purpose Before Pressure'', can shape the choices you make now in your studies, work, service and relationships. Take one responsible step, learn from it and keep growing. Your example can help another young woman believe that her voice, values and contribution matter.', 'You are not waiting to become a leader; you are learning to lead responsibly now.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi009-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
