 values ('WODDI-WI-010', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 10, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Mentorship Helps You See Further', 'Your voice grows stronger when it is guided by values and action.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. WNNN is a space for young women to discover purpose, practise leadership and grow without pretending to know everything. As you consider ''Mentorship Helps You See Further'', stay open to learning and honest feedback. Confidence is not having every answer; it is being willing to act responsibly, ask for support and improve with each experience.', 'Your voice grows stronger when it is guided by values and action.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi010-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
