 values ('WODDI-WI-011', 'WNNN', 1, 1, 11, 'Identity and Purpose',
  'Discipline Today Builds Influence Tomorrow', 'Confidence is built through responsibility, reflection and practice.', 'As {{RoleTitle}} in {{LocationName}}, your WNNN leadership is strengthening young women in identity, voice and values. Your generation is already influencing communities online and offline. The message ''Discipline Today Builds Influence Tomorrow'' invites you to use that influence with values, care and good judgement. Let your words create safety, let your actions build trust and let your digital presence reflect the kind of leader you are becoming.', 'Confidence is built through responsibility, reflection and practice.',
  'Thank you for leading WNNN with purpose and care.', 'WNNN — Raising the next generation of women leaders.', 'wi011-wnnn', 'Authentic young African women aged 18 to 29 in a safe, confident and purposeful leadership setting; contemporary but professional; inclusive; WODDI colour accents. Build as a polished WODDI/WNNN graphic. Overlay only the approved headline and key thought; keep the full personalised message outside the artwork.', 'approved', null, null)
 on conflict (message_id, network, language, version) do update
